body:
I think we should also provide our users the ability to not trigger the search at each keystroke but rather once `<Enter>` has been pressed.

I was thinking about patching the `searchBox` widget with something like:

```
search.addWidget(
  instantsearch.widgets.searchBox({
    container: '#q',
    // [...]
    instant: false // will only trigger the search when <Enter> is pressed
  })
);
```
